  "description": "A simple in-memory and Redis hybrid caching solution for .NET applications.\n            It provides a way to cache frequently accessed data in memory for fast access and automatically falls back to using Redis as a persistent cache when memory cache capacity is exceeded.",
  "id": "HybridRedisCache",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-10-13T12:49:03.44Z",
